OL,3,AEx-Met Police inspector lied about
OL,4,Awife's death in Barbados
OL,5,
OL,6,FPanorama can reveal failures by
OL,7,FBarbados authorities to preserve
OL,8,Fevidence and interview hotel staff
OL,9,Fabout Arter's suspicious behaviour
OL,10,Fbefore and after Rebekah's death, aged
OL,11,F47.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
