OL,3,AStaggered age of consent to be
OL,4,Adiscussed after Brand allegations,
OL,5,Aminister says
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman who alleges she was raped by
OL,8,Fthe jailed comedian when she was 16 is
OL,9,Fnow campaigning to see the law changed
OL,10,Fso that relationships between 16-and
OL,11,F17-year-olds and adults would be
OL,12,Fillegal.
OL,14,FQuestions over a staggered age of
OL,15,Fconsent have "been raised and will be
OL,16,Fdiscussed" McFadden said, adding: "[I]
OL,17,Fcan't tell you what the conclusion of
OL,18,Fthat would be, but the last week has
OL,19,Fcertainly put that up in lights."
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
