OL,3,AIsrael kills Hamas commander in strike
OL,4,Aon Gaza camp, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior Hamas figure who helped plan
OL,7,Fand oversee the 7 October 2023 attack
OL,8,Fon Israel has been killed in an Israeli
OL,9,Fairstrike, officials in Israel and Gaza
OL,10,Fhave said.
OL,12,FSamir Abu Younis, the newly appointed
OL,13,Fcommander of the Rafah Brigade, was
OL,14,Fkilled on Saturday in Al-Mawasi in the
OL,15,Fsouthern Gaza Strip, according to
OL,16,FHamas's Al-Qassam Brigades military
OL,17,Fwing.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
