OL,3,AFifth Canadian soldier dies from
OL,4,Ainjuries caused by large fire at
OL,5,Amilitary base
OL,6,
OL,7,FA fifth Canadian soldier has died from
OL,8,Finjuries he suffered when a grass fire
OL,9,Fswept through a military training area
OL,10,Flast month.
OL,12,FFour people were killed initially and
OL,13,Fdozens were injured when the fire,
OL,14,Fwhich ignited during a live fire
OL,15,Ftraining exercise, spread rapidly
OL,16,Fthrough Canadian Forces Base Wainwright
OL,17,Fcarried by strong winds on 17 October.
OL,19,FPte William Douglas Dal Bianco, who had
OL,20,Fbeen receiving medical care in Ontario,
OL,21,Fdied on Friday, the Canadian Armed
OL,22,FForces said in a statement.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
